<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

The `LarDiskProjector` class holds every field the projector's modules share and hands that state to each module through `core`. Its public surface and its exported names carry every caller unchanged; `flush`, `reconcile` and `atomicWrite` stay instance methods, so an instance override still answers each internal call. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

<<~/ahu>>

